### Step 15 — Test Every Scenario

Go to your checkout page and test each card:

```
✅ Successful payment
   Card:     4242 4242 4242 4242
   Expected: Order → paid + processing → confirmation page
   Check:    Terminal 3 shows "payment_intent.succeeded"

✅ Declined card
   Card:     4000 0000 0000 0002
   Expected: Red error message shown, order stays pending

✅ 3D Secure (requires extra authentication step)
   Card:     4000 0025 0000 3155
   Expected: Stripe shows auth popup → user confirms → payment succeeds

✅ Insufficient funds
   Card:     4000 0000 0000 9995
   Expected: "Your card has insufficient funds" error shown

✅ Webhook received
   After any payment → Terminal 3 shows:
   --> payment_intent.created  [evt_xxx]  200 OK
   --> payment_intent.succeeded [evt_xxx] 200 OK
```

