## Common Errors & Fixes

```
Error: "No API key provided"
Fix:   STRIPE_SECRET missing from .env
       Run: php artisan config:clear

Error: "Invalid API Key provided"
Fix:   Key is incomplete — copy the full key including sk_test_ prefix

Error: "Amount must be at least $0.50"
Fix:   order->total is 0 or too small — Stripe minimum is 50 cents

Error: Webhook signature verification failed
Fix:   STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET in .env doesn't match what stripe listen printed
       Make sure you restarted Laravel after updating .env

Error: 419 Page Expired on payment.intent route
Fix:   CSRF token missing — check the X-CSRF-TOKEN header in the fetch() call

Error: VITE_STRIPE_KEY is undefined in Vue
Fix:   Key must start with VITE_ in .env — restart npm run dev after adding it

Error: "loadStripe is not a function"
Fix:   Run: npm install @stripe/stripe-js
       Then restart: npm run dev
```

